# No environment variables are required for this site.
#
# All third-party integrations are client-side public embeds:
#   - Calendly booking widget (public scheduling URL in index.html)
#   - YouTube testimonial embed (public video in index.html)
#   - Google Fonts (public stylesheet link in index.html)
#
# If you later add services that need keys (analytics, email capture APIs,
# etc.), define them here as KEY=value examples and keep real values in .env,
# which is gitignored.
